WEBVTT

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.480
You people are such a weak race!

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.130
Doesn't this country have any strong men?

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.360
Make this more exciting!

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.360
Here are your gum and chocolate.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.860
Pick them up, nipponese.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.490
Forgive me. This is all I could make.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:22.450
S'only because Kamogawa isn't earning enough.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.950
Shut up and eat, freeloader!

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:26.750
I'm choking!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:27.960
Here's some water!

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.090
Thank yew.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.260
God, what're you doing?!

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.590
So I was meaning to ask you:

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.780
Where did you come from?

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.030
I know it's not Tokyo.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.540
Oh, was I not supposed to pry?

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.120
No...

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:01.290
Hey, what's wrong?

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.980
<i>W-What the hell?</i>

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.550
<i>My hand's gone numb.</i>

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:13.050
<i>What's... happening to me?</i>

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.100
Yuki-san, did you...

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:21.180
come from Hiroshima?

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:27.570
I didn't want you to know.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:34.020
I came to Tokyo looking for the strength to live.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:40.580
Back when I lived there, I kept remembering that event.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.570
I spent my days with my head held low.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:49.430
I don't know what's happening to me or when it'll happen.

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:54.670
So I thought if I could come to the newly revived Tokyo and mingle with the people...

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:57.610
I wanted to feel alive.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:00.320
I wanted hope.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.480
Look, you don't have to say anything.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:07.480
I saw you two fight when I arrived in Tokyo.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:13.450
Seeing you two persevere gave me the strength I needed.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:16.240
It gave me the courage to live.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:21.730
I was really glad I had the chance to live with you two.

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:26.210
I had fun watching you two fight and train together.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:31.030
You two always make me happy.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:34.290
So I wanted to be your pillar of support.

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:37.950
I didn't want you to know.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:41.710
I didn't want to be pitied or be seen in a different light.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:47.360
I wanted... I wanted to spend...

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:52.670
what little time I have left living this life.

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:03.100
Nothing will change.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:07.790
I didn't ask anything. I didn't hear anything.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.320
My home is your home, if that's what you want.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.630
Nothing will change.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.660
<i>She sure is brave.</i>

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:50.000
<i>If I were her, would I act anywhere near as cheerful?</i>

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.170
<i>She's a strong woman.</i>

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.920
Good morning!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.180
And what a good morning it is!

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:58.210
Yeah.

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:01.680
<i>I still have a lot to learn.</i>

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.220
Where's Nekota-san?

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.300
I haven't seen him since last night.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.940
Lazy bum!

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:09.910
I'm back!

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.700
Welcome home—

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.940
What happened? You're covered in bruises!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.030
Yuki-san, I got yew a present.

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:20.080
A-A blouse? Are you sure?

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.030
But I thought...

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:24.440
You're supposed to be dead broke! 
Where did you steal that?

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:24.870
Here!

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:28.540
Yew ain't gonna call me a freeloader no more!

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.820
A tricycle cab?

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:36.010
That's cool!

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:38.080
So this is how you earn your money?

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.600
So why all the bruises?

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.600
Are yew all right, sir?

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:48.600
There was nothing around here to crash into!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.910
That's it, I'm going to walk!

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.720
And I'm not paying!

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.070
I'm sorry.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.770
I'm pedaling straight, aren't I?

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.320
So why do I keep getting into accidents?

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:05.110
Anyway, I need to get paid so I can get Yuki-san a present!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:08.870
A-Another blouse?

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:09.870
Can I have it?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.230
Of course yew can.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:14.940
Now, why are yew wearing the same blouse I just bought for yew?

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:18.020
You were the one who gave me it!

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:21.090
You must love this dress enough to buy a second one.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.570
<i>I gave that to her?</i>

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:28.270
<i>Impossible! I don't remember doing that!</i>

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:32.900
<i>Again?!</i>

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.420
<i>This numbness just comes and goes.</i>

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:40.570
<i>I'm starting to lose my balance...</i>

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.990
<i>I get headaches...</i>

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:44.400
<i>Is this only temporary?</i>

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:48.450
<i>But, I know for a fact that...</i>

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.880
<i>little by little...</i>

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.020
<i>my nerves are getting damaged!</i>

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.550
<i>Ever since that fight...</i>

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.990
<i>No, who cares about the cause!</i>

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:06.140
<i>What the hell's... happening to me?</i>

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:10.050
<i>What's... going to happen to me?</i>

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.640
Okay, that's three minutes!

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:22.710
Goddammit! I didn't even hit him once!

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.910
Yew aren't committed enough.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:27.240
<i>Good, I'm perfectly fine.</i>

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.160
<i>It was only temporary.</i>

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:32.210
Screw this! I'm going to work!

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:33.730
Now then...

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.940
Oh, um, Yuki-san!

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:36.670
Yes?

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:41.970
I've done been to a bunch of places on my cab.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:45.180
I'll show yew if yer willing to hop on!

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.920
I'll give yew a tour of Tokyo!

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:48.670
I'd love to!

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:51.770
Please, stop!

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.810
Do you always drive like this?!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:56.560
No wonder you get into accidents!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.510
My apologies.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.820
Guess I got carried away.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.290
Tokyo is so amazing!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.310
It's so busy and prosperous!

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:27.470
I also get surprised, being a country boy myself.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:29.170
Where did you come from?

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.630
Nowhere worth mentioning.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:34.480
Except maybe for its unspoiled wilderness.

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:36.600
It sounds like a nice place.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:41.590
M-Maybe one day I'll get to show yew...

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:43.540
where I was born!

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.360
That GI.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.870
That wasn't enough. Give me a real fight.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.190
Let's go.

00:07:57.190 --> 00:08:01.380
I hate seeing those fights. All he does is pick on the weak.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.560
There are no hopes or dreams to be had.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:09.890
I don't want to see yew looking down.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.340
Yew wanna see...

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:16.890
a fight that'll fill yew with strength?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.300
Y-You can't! It's too risky!

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.270
Don't tell Kamogawa.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.520
He'll probably be against it anyway.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.030
He wants all the glory for himself.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:28.820
Kamogawa.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.330
Huh?

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.230
Oh, it's you, Dankichi.

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:34.410
He took out another Japanese man.

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:38.350
This makes six he's sent to the hospital.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.920
Doesn't that include you?

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.190
Aren't you even bothered by it?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.890
Got nothing to do with me, is all.

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:48.930
Whoever wants to fight him is free to do it.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:54.930
Makes no sense complaining about losing a fight you had no chance of winning.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:58.170
So you're turning a blind eye claiming they had no chance?

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.310
Where the hell is your Japanese spirit?

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.510
I don't believe in it.

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.650
Boxing is divided into weight classes.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:09.000
The matches are fair if you fight someone sharing your weight and stature.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.700
That's why I question whether it's simply the lack of spirit or skills.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:15.760
That GI is larger than any of us.

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:18.460
He's not someone you should test your boxing skills on.

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:21.070
Okay, you win.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.180
You're right on all accounts.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:26.280
Thought I could rile you into fighting him, but you won't bite.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:27.470
Sorry.

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:32.110
You and Nekota were the only ones with a real chance.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:36.770
Actually, he's already beaten both of us at a dark street corner.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:37.730
What?

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:40.970
That GI's boxing was based on cold logic.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.280
My chin agrees with you.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:46.980
He goes after your weak spots like a damn machine.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.740
If there's anyone who has a chance against him...

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:50.700
...it'd be Nekota!

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.420
I hate to admit it,

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:57.200
but he's by far the best fighter among the three of us.

00:09:57.410 --> 00:10:00.680
Maybe it's because he was raised deep in the mountains,

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:03.500
but his instincts are similar to a wild animal's.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:07.120
If anything can throw that fighting machine out of whack,

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.270
it'll definitely be his animal instincts!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.550
But don't tell Nekota any of this.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.180
That guy would definitely jump at the chance.

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:24.230
Even if he could throw that machine off kilter, winning would still be next to impossible.

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:29.920
If a man takes a punch from someone a lot bigger than him,

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.740
it will damage him all too easy.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:37.710
I want him around as my rival so we can improve each other.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:38.740
And besides...

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:43.350
The three of us are living together due to the circumstances.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.460
And it's not as bad as I thought.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.910
Just say you're having a blast.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.970
What's the matter, driver? Are you okay?

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.470
What happened?

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:58.720
Oh, my driver suddenly vomited...

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.720
<i>It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!</i>

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.730
<i>It feels like my head is splitting!</i>

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.560
Hey, he's having convulsions!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.510
Someone call a doctor!

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:08.690
Don't!

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:12.700
Don't... call a doctor!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.430
<i>Shit!</i>

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.620
<i>It's happening more and more frequently!</i>

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:26.130
<i>And it's... getting more severe!</i>

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:32.630
<i>Goddammit... Goddammit... Goddammit!</i>

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:35.590
Welcome back!

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.510
Uh, yeah.

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:40.190
Isn't Kamogawa home yet?

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.110
No.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.310
Then I guess I'll eat without him.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.850
This is fantastic!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.520
It's just a sweet potato.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:50.730
So, isn't Kamogawa home yet?

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.590
Huh?

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:53.120
No...

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:55.670
Okay, I see. Gonna take him a while.

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:57.610
Hmm?

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.910
Oh, nothing!

00:11:58.910 --> 00:11:59.970
‘Kay.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:04.410
<i>This has happened before.</i>

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.640
<i>He'd say the same thing over again.</i>

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:10.840
<i>Nekota-san can be a scatterbrain.</i>

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.590
<i>But...</i>

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.820
I'm home.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:15.990
Welcome back!

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:18.760
Yer late! I was about to eat everything!

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.640
Can't believe how bustling this place has gotten.

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:24.120
But yew like the activity.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.600
Screw you! It gets in the way of my training!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.170
I-I'm in your way?

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:30.310
What's yer problem?!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.150
Get lost if yew don't like it!

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.290
This is my house!

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.150
Gaah! Yuki-san's about to cry!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.700
Ahh! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:38.160
Goddamn this!

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:54.130
<i>Yeah, this ain't so bad.</i>

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:57.970
<i>If I could, I'd stop time...</i>

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:08.910
What's wrong?

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.060
The sunflowers.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:14.410
Oh, right. Summer's about to end.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:18.360
Feels kind of sad losing these showy flowers.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:22.840
But these flowers leave behind a lot of seeds.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:25.460
They'll come back and cheer us up again.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.620
I wish...

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.210
I can see them next year.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.310
You will!

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:36.260
Bet on it!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.470
Don't act so damn dejected!

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:42.680
You're only gonna make a guy glum by saying that!

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:45.470
Someone... will be sad?

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.250
You must know by now.

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:51.310
You see him every day. Nekota has feelings—

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:52.980
Please stop!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:55.950
I'm...

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.250
I'm going to repeat your words,

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:02.870
but have you noticed by now?

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:08.370
How I... feel about you.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:18.920
I...

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:30.200
You better go inside.

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.940
This isn't good for your health.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:41.490
<i>Shit! Why did I let it get to me?!</i>

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.910
<i>What was I even about to say?!</i>

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.610
<i>You know damn well how Nekota feels!</i>

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.160
<i>You want to betray him, you jackass?!</i>

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:51.160
<i>Forget about your feelings!</i>

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.470
<i>Weren't you also steeling your mind?</i>

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:55.670
<i>Don't you dare betray Nekota!</i>

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:58.380
<i>He's your best friend!</i>

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:03.930
Welcome back, Kamo—

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:10.470
There's something I need to tell yew.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.060
Wh... What is it?

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:16.180
I laid all the groundwork in secret.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.500
But I really need yew to see this.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:21.740
Tomorrow...

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.490
I'm fighting that GI!

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:29.140
I'm going to win.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:35.090
My fight is going to give yew strength, and I'm going to win.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:37.040
Nekota-san...

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:42.210
But... it gonna be my last fight.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:46.060
After this match, I'm going to retire.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.920
I'll have no reason to stay here,

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.050
so I was thinking I'd go back to the mountains.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:53.080
Wi...

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.480
Will yew come with me? Will yew follow me back home?!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.560
The air's good, and yew'll really love it!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.990
It's just the right place for yew to rest up!

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:06.780
I'm sure yew'll recover from...

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:14.290
You knew about my disease?

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.970
I want to know yer answer!

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.270
After the match!

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:23.070
Nekota-san!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:47.790
<i>I can't even... tape my own hand right.</i>

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:51.530
<i>My headaches and numbness are coming regularly now!</i>

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:54.620
<i>I'm...</i>

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:56.970
<i>I'm scared!</i>

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.130
<i>He scares me!</i>

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:03.040
<i>I ain't afraid of his punches.</i>

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:04.610
<i>But...</i>

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:09.070
<i>I'm afraid I won't make something happen!</i>

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:14.270
<i>Please! Just this one match...</i>

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:17.720
<i>Let me fight this one match!</i>

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:19.100
<i>Please!</i>

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:22.580
<i>I don't want her to keep her head down!</i>

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.860
<i>I want to give her strength!</i>

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:30.190
<i>She's... just like a sunflower!</i>

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.690
<i>Yuki-san...</i>

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.910
<i>Yuki-san, Yuki-san...</i>

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:36.950
<i>Yuki-san!</i>

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.880
Nekota's fighting that GI?!

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.290
First I've heard about it!

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.190
He told me to keep it a secret.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.040
That dithering idiot!

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.870
I don't care what happens to him!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:54.890
But...

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:57.390
Something's wrong with Nekota-san!

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:01.580
That's right!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:03.990
But...

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.070
No.

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:07.940
He's definitely punch drunk.

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:10.590
Now that I think about it, it all makes sense.

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:13.600
But he dodged all of your punches during practice.

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:18.000
It comes and goes like a switch. A switch in his brain!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.580
It's time, Nekota! Let's go!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:25.210
<i>Just a little longer.</i>

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:27.730
<i>Just a little longer and it'll be over!</i>

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.010
<i>Please!</i>

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:32.340
<i>Hurry up and be done with!</i>

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:35.300
Let's go, Nekota! You got a fight!

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:39.250
<i>I got a fight.</i>

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.100
<i>And it's about to start.</i>

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:45.390
<i>The boxing match is about to begin.</i>

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.870
<i>That crazy dumbass!</i>

00:18:55.470 --> 00:19:01.370
<i>He's going in the ring knowing about both his and Yuki-san's condition!</i>

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:03.940
<i>You're a man's man, Nekota!</i>

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:05.250
<i>But!</i>

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:10.530
<i>If you're really punch drunk, you're putting your life on the line!</i>

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:13.980
He's here!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:14.990
It's Nekota!

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:16.760
I believe in you!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:19.120
Hey, look at his shorts!

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:23.770
<i>It's the number of japanese{lowercase} I've put on the ground.</i>

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:26.770
<i>Just a little souvenir for when I go stateside.</i>

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:31.030
<i>Hurry up. I need yew here.</i>

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.280
<i>I'm only fighting for a set amount of time.</i>

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.270
<i>I promise to teach him a lesson within that timeframe.</i>

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:39.030
<i>So hurry.</i>

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:43.410
<i>This is the last time yew get to see me fight!</i>

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.920
Nekota!

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:48.830
Nekota!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.920
Nekota-san?!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.680
So yew came?
